@startuml ProximaDB Data Flow Diagram
!theme plain
title ProximaDB - System Data Flow Diagram

!define ENTITY(x) class x << (E,#FFAAAA) >>
!define PROCESS(x) class x << (P,#AAAAFF) >>
!define STORAGE(x) class x << (S,#AAFFAA) >>

ENTITY(Client) {
  + Vector data
  + Metadata
  + Search queries
}

PROCESS(APIGateway) {
  + REST endpoint
  + gRPC endpoint
  + Request validation
  + Response formatting
}

PROCESS(VectorService) {
  + Insert processing
  + Search coordination
  + Batch optimization
  + Metric collection
}

STORAGE(WAL) {
  + Memory buffer
  + Disk segments
  + Recovery log
}

PROCESS(FlushProcess) {
  + Batch reading
  + Deserialization
  + Routing logic
}

STORAGE(LSMStorage) {
  + Memtable
  + SSTables
  + Bloom filters
}

STORAGE(VIPERStorage) {
  + Parquet files
  + ML clusters
  + Quantized data
}

PROCESS(CompactionProcess) {
  + File merging
  + Deduplication
  + TTL cleanup
}

PROCESS(SearchEngine) {
  + Query planning
  + Multi-tier search
  + Result merging
}

STORAGE(IndexStructures) {
  + HNSW graphs
  + IVF lists
  + Quantization codes
}

PROCESS(QuantizationEngine) {
  + Vector compression
  + Codebook management
  + Quality monitoring
}

STORAGE(MetadataStore) {
  + Collection configs
  + Index metadata
  + System state
}

ENTITY(MonitoringSystem) {
  + Prometheus metrics
  + Performance data
  + Health status
}

' Insert Flow
Client --> APIGateway : "1. Send vectors"
APIGateway --> VectorService : "2. Validated request"
VectorService --> WAL : "3. Write to WAL"
VectorService --> IndexStructures : "4. Update indexes"
WAL --> FlushProcess : "5. Trigger flush"
FlushProcess --> LSMStorage : "6a. Route to LSM"
FlushProcess --> VIPERStorage : "6b. Route to VIPER"

' Compaction Flow
LSMStorage --> CompactionProcess : "7. Compact SSTables"
VIPERStorage --> CompactionProcess : "8. Merge Parquet files"
CompactionProcess --> LSMStorage : "9. Write compacted"
CompactionProcess --> VIPERStorage : "10. Write optimized"

' Search Flow
Client --> APIGateway : "11. Search query"
APIGateway --> VectorService : "12. Search request"
VectorService --> SearchEngine : "13. Create search plan"
SearchEngine --> WAL : "14. Search unflushed"
SearchEngine --> LSMStorage : "15. Search recent"
SearchEngine --> VIPERStorage : "16. Search compacted"
SearchEngine --> IndexStructures : "17. Use indexes"
SearchEngine --> VectorService : "18. Merged results"
VectorService --> APIGateway : "19. Format response"
APIGateway --> Client : "20. Return results"

' Quantization Flow
VIPERStorage --> QuantizationEngine : "21. Vectors to quantize"
QuantizationEngine --> VIPERStorage : "22. Quantized vectors"
QuantizationEngine --> IndexStructures : "23. Update quantized indexes"

' Metadata Flow
VectorService --> MetadataStore : "24. Read/Write metadata"
CompactionProcess --> MetadataStore : "25. Update stats"
SearchEngine --> MetadataStore : "26. Get collection info"

' Monitoring Flow
VectorService --> MonitoringSystem : "27. Operation metrics"
WAL --> MonitoringSystem : "28. WAL metrics"
LSMStorage --> MonitoringSystem : "29. Storage metrics"
VIPERStorage --> MonitoringSystem : "30. VIPER metrics"

note top of Client
  Data formats:
  - JSON (REST)
  - Protobuf (gRPC)
  - Avro (internal)
end note

note right of WAL
  Write patterns:
  - Sequential writes
  - Batch optimization
  - Async flushing
end note

note bottom of SearchEngine
  Search optimization:
  - Polymorphic routing
  - Two-stage search
  - Predicate pushdown
end note

note left of QuantizationEngine
  Compression levels:
  - INT8 (8-bit)
  - PQ8/PQ4 (product)
  - Binary (1-bit)
end note

@enduml